#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:313
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_TodayWonSmartnessContest"
msgid ""
"This POKéMON won the BEAUTY CONTEST\n"
"here before.\p"
"Well, guess what? Today, I made it\n"
"win a SMARTNESS CONTEST!\p"
"My abilities scare even me…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:320
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_EnteredBunchOfContests"
msgid ""
"I've entered a bunch of CONTESTS,\n"
"so I'm seeing how things work.\p"
"If you're in a COOLNESS CONTEST,\n"
"cool moves go over as appeals.\p"
"But smart moves and cute moves\n"
"don't go over well, for instance.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:328
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_ManWhoWonEarlierHadPokeblocks"
msgid ""
"That young man who won earlier had\n"
"a whole bunch of different {POKEBLOCK}S.\p"
"Can you win if you had that many\n"
"of those things?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:334
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_IsntThisPlaceHumongous"
msgid ""
"Whoa, isn't this place humongous!\p"
"The tension in the air… It's not\n"
"like a CONTEST hall in the sticks.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:339
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_GiveItBestSmartAppeal"
msgid ""
"MC: Okay, SMART POKéMON and their\n"
"TRAINERS, are you ready?!\p"
"Give it your best showing!\n"
"Let's appeal!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:345
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_AreYouEnjoyingThisContest"
msgid ""
"JUDGE: Are you enjoying this CONTEST?\p"
"Come back with three friends, and\n"
"all of you may enter a CONTEST!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:350
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_EnteredWrongContest"
msgid ""
"Ayayayay…\n"
"I entered the wrong CONTEST.\p"
"I entered this tough POKéMON in\n"
"the SMARTNESS CONTEST…\p"
"Come on, wow them with a smart-looking\n"
"ROCK SMASH.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:358
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_RaisedMonToBeSmart"
msgid ""
"I've spent many a year, and all my\n"
"wisdom besides, raising this POKéMON\l"
"to be smart.\p"
"It won't be easily bested by some\n"
"young pup's POKéMON.\p"
"My dear wife, are you seeing this?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:366
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_IfMonPullsSmartMoveNext"
msgid ""
"There it is!\p"
"If my POKéMON pulls a smart move next,\n"
"the audience's excitement will peak!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:371
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_DontAppreciateCuteLeechLife"
msgid ""
"Oh, dear, no!\p"
"My darling ZUBAT's LEECH LIFE is so\n"
"cute I kept using it over and over!\p"
"But these mean people don't appreciate\n"
"it at all!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:378
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_YoureBeautifulGrandpa"
msgid "Kiyaaah! You're beautiful, Grandpa!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:381
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_AllSeemToUseDifferentMoves"
msgid ""
"Even when TRAINERS enter the same\n"
"kind of POKéMON, they all seem to use\l"
"different moves for appeals.\p"
"It's just like the way people have\n"
"different styles for battling.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:388
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_PokemonSmarterThanTrainers"
msgid ""
"I think the POKéMON look smarter\n"
"than their TRAINERS. By a lot.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:392
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_StillLoveSmartnessContests"
msgid ""
"When all's said and done, I still love\n"
"SMARTNESS CONTESTS.\p"
"That intellectual green color…\n"
"It's so… So… Cool.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:398
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_AreYouEnteringBeautyContest"
msgid ""
"MC: Are you entering the BEAUTY\n"
"CONTEST, too? Good luck!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:402
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_EveryPokemonPristineBeauty"
msgid ""
"JUDGE: Ah, every POKéMON here is\n"
"a model of pristine beauty!\p"
"Why, I almost forgot to score them!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:407
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_EyesWillBeGluedToMyBeauty"
msgid ""
"A POKéMON this beautiful…\n"
"There isn't another one like it.\p"
"Everyone's eyes will be glued to\n"
"my beauty.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:413
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_OverdidGrooming"
msgid ""
"Waaaah!\p"
"I brushed and groomed my POKéMON\n"
"carefully for this CONTEST…\p"
"But I overdid it…\n"
"My POKéMON's coat turned all scraggly…\p"
"What should I do?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:421
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_JudgeWontSeeAuroraBeam"
msgid ""
"This AURORA BEAM is so dazzling,\n"
"the JUDGE won't be able to see it.\p"
"Uh, wait a second…\n"
"That'll be meaningless, then!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:427
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_PokemonLooksLikeYoungerMe"
msgid ""
"This pretty POKéMON looks just like\n"
"me when I was younger.\p"
"Right when I said that, my husband\n"
"spewed the coffee he was drinking.\p"
"Did I say something funny?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:434
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_WinBeautyContestMakesMeHappy"
msgid ""
"You know, if I win at a BEAUTY\n"
"CONTEST, sure it makes me\l"
"happy. More than usual, anyway.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:439
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_GanderAtAllThosePrettyPokemon"
msgid ""
"Wahahahah!\p"
"Will you take a gander at all those\n"
"pretty POKéMON!\l"
"I just love this sort of glitz!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:445
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_CantWinOnBeautyAlone"
msgid ""
"You can't always win on just beauty\n"
"alone.\p"
"You have to groom your POKéMON so\n"
"it's nice and glossy like mine.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:451
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_InTheMiddleOfContest"
msgid ""
"MC: Uh-oh! Hello!\n"
"We're in the middle of a CONTEST!\p"
"Please enter at our registration\n"
"counter and come out, okay?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:457
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_SuchCharmingCuteAppeals"
msgid ""
"JUDGE: Oh, such charming and cute\n"
"appeals!\p"
"Oh, my goodness! What a perfectly\n"
"adorable WATER SPORT appeal!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:463
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_MyAzurillWasDistracted"
msgid ""
"Oh, no… My sweet AZURILL was\n"
"distracted by another POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:467
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_NeverWonBattleButContest"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON has never won in a battle,\n"
"but put it in a CONTEST and look out!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:471
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_PetalDanceIsMarvel"
msgid ""
"My POKéMON's PETAL DANCE is a marvel\n"
"of elegance.\p"
"I won't let anyone disturb its\n"
"performance.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:477
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_MyMonAppealSoMuchCuter"
msgid ""
"Everyone's POKéMON are very cute.\p"
"However, if my POKéMON were to make\n"
"a cute appeal…\p"
"I'm sure that it would be so much \n"
"cuter than the others.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:484
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_MyChildIsInContest"
msgid "My child is in this CONTEST.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:487
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_ComeOnDear"
msgid ""
"Come on, dear. Go for it!\n"
"Your POKéMON is the best!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:491
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_ThatGirlThereIsCutest"
msgid ""
"I think that girl over there is\n"
"the cutest of the lot.\p"
"What's that? They're judging\n"
"POKéMON by their looks?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:497
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_WantCuteMonOfMyOwn"
msgid ""
"Ohh, seeing all these cute POKéMON,\n"
"they make we want to get my own!\p"
"I'm going to go catch some!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:502
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_BeautyContestStage"
msgid ""
"BEAUTY CONTEST STAGE\n"
"BE ALLURED BY BEAUTIFUL POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:506
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_CuteContestStage"
msgid ""
"CUTENESS CONTEST STAGE\n"
"BE CHARMED BY CUTE POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestHall/scripts.inc:510
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestHall_Text_SmartContestStage"
msgid ""
"SMARTNESS CONTEST STAGE\n"
"BE IMPRESSED BY SMART POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
